            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igihe Uhoraho yagomba kujana Eliya mu gashururu ngw amudūgane mw ijuru, Eliya na Elisa bāri mu nzira bava i Gilugali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "RUT.1.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rus 1:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "RUT.1.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "RUT.3.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "3:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Eliya abarira Elisa, at’ Enda sigara hano, kuk’ Uhoraho antumye i Beteli. Elisa aramwishura, ati Ndahiye uguhoraho kw’Uhoraho, nawe nyene ndakurahiye, sintandukana nawe. Nuko baramanuka baja i Beteli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.20.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abam 20:35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.4.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Abam 4:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.4.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bashitseyo, abīgishirizwa i Beteli ivy’ ukuvugishwa baza gusanganira Elisa, baramubaza, bati Harya urazi yuk’ uyu musi Uhoraho agiye kukwaka shobuja? Arabishura, at’ Ego me ndabizi, ariko ni mupfe gucereza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.16.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abam 16:34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Eliya yongera kumubarira, at’ Enda rero Elisa, sigara hano, kuk’ Uhoraho antumye i Yeriko. Aramwishura, ati Ndahiye uguhoraho kw’Uhoraho, nawe nyene ndakurahiye, sintandukana nawe. Nuko baja i Yeriko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bashitseyo, abīgishirizwa i Yeriko ivy’ ukuvugishwa baza kuri Elisa baramubaza, bati Harya urazi yuk’ uyu musi Uhoraho agiye kukwaka shobuja? Arabishura, at’ Ego me ndabizi, ariko ni mupfe gucereza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliya yongera kumubarira, at’ Enda sigara hano, kuk’ Uhoraho antumye kuri Yorodani. Na we aramwishura, ati Ndahiye uguhoraho kw’Uhoraho, nawe nyene ndakurahiye, sintandukana nawe. Nuko bompi barajana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ abantu mirongwitanu mu biga ivy’ ukuvugishwa baragenda bahagarara kure aharābana na bo, abo bompi bagihagaze kuri Yorodani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.14.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 14:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.3.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 3:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.19.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abam 19:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Eliya yābīra umutamana wiwe, arawuzinga, awukubitisha amazi, aca yigabanyamwo kubiri, amwe aja ukwayo ayandi ukwayo, nuko bompi bajabukira ahūmūtse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
