            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.2.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Abam 2:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze bamwe b’i Yeriko biga ivy’ ukuvugishwa, bār’ aharābana na we, baravuga, bat’ Impwemu ya Eliya iri kuri Elisa. Nuko baraza, baramusanganira, bakubita inkoro hasi imbere yiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.18.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abam 18:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.8.39"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyak 8:39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baramubarira, bati Twebge abasavyi bawe turi kumwe n’ abantu b’inkomezi mirongwitanu; nuko turakwinginze, reka bagende baje kurondera shobuja; kumbure Mpwemu w’Uhoraho yoba yamuteruye, akamuterera ku musozi muremure, canke mu mwonga. Aravuga, at’ Oya, ntimubarungike. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
