              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bukeye avayo, adūga i Beteli; akiri mu nzira arikw aradūga, haza abana b’abahungu bavuye mu gisagara baramutwenga, baramubarira, bati Dūga, busa bg’ubuhanza! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
